"P2134065112" "It looks like that Council agent may have been telling the truth when he warned you of their other facilities. I have located one in Talos Island; it looks like it's been around for awhile, so they probably have a full supply of Zenith Mech Men. That's a good thing, because we need to know everything we can about these new Mech Men. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to shut down that facility and return with any data you find.</a>"
