// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4237683471" "The last Mech Man production facility is in Talos Island. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you can shut down that facility, we may be able to completely wipe out the threat these advanced Zenith Mech Men pose.</A>"
// SendOffString :
"P2853934245" "You have performed admirably in this quest, my friends. I have no doubt you can see it through it the end."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3152610980" "There's one more Mech Man production plant for you to shut down."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4031906306" "There's {TaskForceName}. Open fire!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P515063961" "Production in this facility is obviously booming. The loud noise of the machinery masks your entrance nicely."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P2106977457" "If this facility falls, the Center will have our heads."
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P4225874114" "Don't worry, my friend. We shall not fail!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P748988601" "Bulwark"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2476273693" "Orders received: Await {TaskForceName} and terminate."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P704241537" "{TaskForceName} identified. Proceeding with maximum force."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1850530454" "Computer System"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4134757310" "You have disabled the Council computer and accessed an important file."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1371259731" "You shut down the Council facility and discovered that Vandal is behind the Zenith Mech Man enhancements."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4065930658" "Vandal. I haven't heard that name in years. It was the code name of Othman Doul, the technical genius behind the Zenith Mech Men. Vandal's designs have only become more radical since he began working under the auspices of the Council. I should have known he was behind these new, advanced robots."
// RandomFameString :
"P2569583018" "I heard that {TaskForceName} is going after Vandal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1830031431" "This task is extremely dangerous, {TaskForceName}. And it is extremely important to me. If Vandal is using my technology to create these new, advanced Zenith Mech Men, then I am, in some way, responsible for the havoc they will wreak. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please arrest Vandal and ensure that he will do no more harm.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P367908343" "Arrest Vandal"
// SendOffString :
"P1865421887" "You have my gratitude, {TaskForceName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P949790114" "Defeat Vandal and his minions"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P111743717" "Vandal is the mastermind behind the Council's robots. If you can capture him, it'll be a big loss for the Council."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2983314824" "You'll never touch Vandal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2995744522" "Filled with grim determination, you begin your assault on Vandal's base."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2594690832" "Vandal"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P285182702" "It comes to this. Citadel thinks his minions can deal with me."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1260907317" "Let us see if you can defeat someone who has created greater things than you have dreamed of!"
// Script Variable BOSS_1STBLOOD_DIALOG :
"P2314984589" "<em laugh> You stand no chance."
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3346590096" "I will not fall to you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P94899873" "8.1.8.5.2.0.7."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1799764243" "Q.6.8.0.0."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2558306111" "You have defeated Vandal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2647671973" "I cannot thank you enough for your efforts in these past few days. I must admit, I was deeply disturbed by the idea that my own technology was being used to improve the Council's Zenith Mech Men! Now that their creator is behind bars, I can hold my head up high."
// RandomFameString :
"P1324488965" "{TaskForceName} defeated Vandal!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2150827220" "There is no possible way for me to repay this debt. I am eternally grateful."
// RandomFameString :
"P2581581700" "{TaskForceName} took down Vandal, one of the worst menaces the Council had to offer!"
